{"title":"Career roadmap — Investment Banking Analyst","role":"Investment Banking Analyst","summary":"An Investment Banking Analyst supports companies and investors on M&A, fundraising, IPOs, financial restructuring, valuation, due diligence, and capital-market transactions. The role is highly analytical and demanding, requiring strong financial modelling, accounting, valuation, research, presentation and attention to detail.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"Integrated Programme in Management (IPM – BBA+MBA)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an IPM graduate, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Corporate Finance","Financial Modelling","Valuation","Capital Markets","Excel","PowerPoint","Deal Research","Communication"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Investment Banking Analyst / Corporate Finance Analyst; develop modelling, valuation and transaction skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Associate / Senior Analyst; execute transactions and manage workstreams"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Vice President; lead transaction execution and client relationships"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Director / Managing Director; originate deals, manage clients and lead major transactions"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Accounting + finance foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial mathematics"},{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Microeconomics"}]},{"type":"p","tex