ue diligence"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Transaction structure"},{"text":"Closing process"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Equity capital markets"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IPO"},{"text":"FPO"},{"text":"Rights issue"},{"text":"Private placement"},{"text":"Follow-on offerings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Debt capital markets"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bonds"},{"text":"Loans"},{"text":"Credit facilities"},{"text":"Refinancing"},{"text":"Debt restructuring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deal documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Teaser"},{"text":"NDA"},{"text":"Information memorandum"},{"text":"Management presentation"},{"text":"Term sheet"},{"text":"Indicative offer"},{"text":"Definitive agreements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Financial databases"},{"text":"Financial research"},{"text":"Power BI/SQL basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project — M&A Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Perform:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Target selection","Industry analysis","Valuation","Deal structure","Synergy analysis","Accretion/dilution","Investment recommendation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Build a transaction portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Complete 3 strong projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Full M&A Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Buyer"},{"text":"Target"},{"text":"Enterprise value"},{"text":"Purchase price"},{"text":"Funding mix"},{"text":"Synergies"},{"text":"Pro forma statements"},{"text":"Accretion/dilution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — IPO Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a hypothetical company preparing for IPO."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"Business model"},{"text":"Financial performance"},{"text":"Comparable companies"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"IPO pricing"},{"text":"Risks"},{"text":"