e-diligence analysis"},{"text":"Scenario generation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But transaction professionals still need to validate outputs and exercise financial judgement."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Data-driven M&A"},{"type":"p","text":"Deal teams will increasingly use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Alternative data"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"AI market intelligence"},{"text":"Automated financial analysis"},{"text":"Predictive modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Technology & AI M&A"},{"type":"p","text":"Increasing specialisation in transactions involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI companies"},{"text":"Cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Enterprise software"},{"text":"Data infrastructure"},{"text":"Robotics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Private Capital"},{"type":"p","text":"Investment banking professionals increasingly interact with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Private equity"},{"text":"Venture capital"},{"text":"Private credit"},{"text":"Infrastructure funds"},{"text":"Sovereign wealth funds"},{"text":"Family offices"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Sustainable Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Growing transaction areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Green bonds"},{"text":"Climate finance"},{"text":"Energy-transition investments"},{"text":"Sustainable infrastructure"},{"text":"ESG-linked financing"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the Investment Banking Analyst role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional analyst:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Collect data","Build model","Prepare slides"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future analyst:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Model scenarios","Evaluate strategic alternatives","Automate analysis","Support transaction decisions"]},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst will increasingly use AI for repetitive work, while human value shifts toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Financial judgement","transaction structuring","strategic thinking","client c